OverTheWire Bandit: Level 0 → 1
Objective:Log in to the Bandit server and retrieve the password for Level 1, which is stored in a file named readme.
Steps
Connect to the server via SSH:
ssh bandit0@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 222
List files in the home directory:
ls
Read the password file:
cat readme
Result
The contents of the readme file provide the password for Bandit Level 1.

